SeaBIOS and EDK II OVMF images for use with vmm(4).

SeaBIOS is an open source implementation of a 16bit X86 BIOS. It can run
in an emulator or it can run natively on X86 hardware with the use of
coreboot.

OVMF is the EDK II UEFI firmware platform for virtual machines.  This
package builds a 4MB, X64, non-SMM OVMF image with serial output and the
platform adaptations needed by vmd(8).
